        <mxCell id="imp4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" value="IMPROVEMENTS:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Each feature scales independently&lt;br&gt;• Failure in one service doesn&#39;t crash all&lt;br&gt;• Teams can work on services separately&lt;br&gt;• Shared cache speeds up reads" vertex="1">
