        <mxCell id="imp5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" value="IMPROVEMENTS:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Kafka handles tasks in background (async)&lt;br&gt;• WebSockets push live updates to students&lt;br&gt;• S3 stores images/videos cheaply&lt;br&gt;• Elasticsearch enables fast question search&lt;br&gt;• WebRTC enables live video proctoring&lt;br&gt;• Auto-save answers in real time" vertex="1">
